        01  WS-FPGA-BEYOND-945-STATE.
            05  WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR            PIC 9(05) VALUE 00256.
            05  WS-TH946-BIN-DAEMON-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH947-STRAT-MERKLE-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH948-PROOF-LAT-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
